codemao-18068.question:
给定以下代码片段，其中数组a是升序排列的整数数组，调用findClosest(a, 5, 8)后，返回值是多少？

```cpp
int findClosest(int a[], int n, int target) {
    int left = 0, right = n - 1;
    if (target <= a[0]) return a[0];
    if (target >= a[n-1]) return a[n-1];
    while (left <= right) {
        int mid = (left + right) / 2;
        if (a[mid] == target) return a[mid];
        else if (a[mid] < target) left = mid + 1;
        else right = mid - 1;
    }
    // 循环结束后，left > right，比较a[right]和a[left]与target的距离
    if (abs(a[left] - target) < abs(a[right] - target))
        return a[left];
    else
        return a[right];
}
```
假设a = {1, 3, 5, 7, 9}，n=5，target=8。

